serverless compute platform.

00:01:05.519 --> 00:01:08.990
You deploy functions and
they execute in the cloud.

00:01:08.990 --> 00:01:14.370
And App Engine is the OG
serverless from Cloud Platform.

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:17.540
Web applications, again, serve
totally serverless scales

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:18.060
to zero.

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:22.820
So with App Engine.

